      "prevails": "C2",
      "criterion": "empirical_evidence",
      "rationale": "Accelerationist correctly identifies that current interpretability tools remain experimental and lack the statistical rigor required for a legal mandate. Safetyist proposes a high-stakes engineering standard that does not yet exist in the field of machine learning, making their proposal premature.",
